            <details><summary>Are you licensed and insured?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes, Euro Style Landscape is licensed and insured.</p></details>
